function multiDecisionBadges(t){const a=me(),accepted=Boolean(t.acceptedBy?.[a.teamId]),participant=(t.teamIds||[]).includes(a.teamId),mine=t.votes?.[a.id];if(t.status==='negotiating')return `<div class="trade-decision-strip"><span class="decision-chip ${accepted?'is-accepted':participant?'is-pending':'is-muted'}">${accepted?'You accepted':participant?'Your decision required':'Private negotiation'}</span><span class="decision-chip is-muted">${Object.values(t.acceptedBy||{}).filter(Boolean).length}/${(t.teamIds||[]).length} owners accepted</span></div>`;if(t.status==='committee'){const recused=multiCommitteeConflict(t,a);return `<div class="trade-decision-strip"><span class="decision-chip is-accepted">All owners accepted</span>${canReviewTrades(a)?`<span class="decision-chip ${recused?'is-muted':mine?'is-voted':'is-pending'}">${recused?'Awaiting committee review · You are recused':mine?`You voted ${escapeHtml(mine.vote)}`:'Your committee review is pending'}</span>`:''}</div>`;}if(t.status==='approved')return `<div class="trade-decision-strip"><span class="decision-chip is-approved">Committee approved</span></div>`;if(['rejected','committee-rejected'].includes(t.status)){const who=t.rejectionSource==='committee'||t.status==='committee-rejected'?'Rejected by Trade Committee':`Rejected by ${escapeHtml(t.rejectedByName||acc(t.rejectedBy)?.handle||'Participant')}`;return `<div class="trade-decision-strip"><span class="decision-chip is-rejected">${who}</span></div>`;}return ''}
function multiTradeCard(t){const [label,tone]=multiTradeStatus(t),accepted=Object.values(t.acceptedBy||{}).filter(Boolean).length,teamList=(t.teamIds||[]).map(id=>teamById(id)).filter(Boolean);return`<article class="trade-summary-card card trade-summary-card--multi" data-open-multi-trade="${escapeHtml(String(t.id))}"><div class="trade-summary-card__top"><span class="pill pill--${tone}">${label}</span><span class="trade-number">Trade ${escapeHtml(String(t.id))}</span></div>${multiDecisionBadges(t)}<div class="multi-card-teams">${teamList.map(team=>`<div>${renderTeamMark(team,'team-logo')}<span><strong>${escapeHtml(team.abbr)}</strong><small>${(t.transfers||[]).filter(x=>x.fromTeamId===team.id).length} sent · ${(t.transfers||[]).filter(x=>x.toTeamId===team.id).length} received</small></span></div>`).join('')}</div><div class="trade-summary-card__footer"><span>${escapeHtml(t.updatedAt||t.createdAt||'')}</span><span>${t.status==='negotiating'?`${accepted}/${(t.teamIds||[]).length} owners accepted`:t.status==='committee'?'Awaiting committee review':label}</span></div></article>`}
function multiTradeVisible(t,a=me()){
 if(!t)return false;
 const participant=(t.teamIds||[]).includes(a?.teamId)||t.creatorId===a?.id;
 if(t.status==='negotiating'||t.status==='draft')return participant;
 if(t.status==='committee')return participant||canReviewTrades(a)||a?.role==='commissioner';
 if(['approved','rejected','committee-rejected'].includes(t.status))return participant||a?.role==='commissioner'||(t.status==='approved');
 return participant;
}
function committeeBucketMulti(t,a=me()){if((t.teamIds||[]).includes(a.teamId))return'participating';if(canReviewTrades(a)&&!multiCommitteeConflict(t,a)&&t.votes?.[a.id])return'addressed';if(canReviewTrades(a)&&!multiCommitteeConflict(t,a)&&!t.votes?.[a.id])return'needs-action';return'none'}
